    <md:title>1.4.2: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>5537cf35-8031-4158-977a-d8ca44dee611</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">Jada found a third job option and was offered a position working at a camp for $10.50 per hour. The total bus fare to and from the camp is $8.40. Write an equation that represents how much she will make in a day, \( d \), after working \( h \) hours.</para>
  </section>
</content>
</document>
